            "review": "Natalie C. has been awesome to work with! Not only did she help my fiance pick out the most stunning engagement ring, but also helped us pick out perfect bands for our wedding day. Neither of us knew a lot about this stuff going in, and she was not only accommodating but she also made the process fun. I’d recommend anyone looking for rings or jewelry to make an appointment with her.",
            "author": "Katie N."
          }
        },
        "testimonial_b7w6W4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "review": "If you are looking for an engagement ring store, WEDDING DAY DIAMONDS is definitely the best place! Hilary was so helpful and fun to work with. My best friend and I went into this store to try on engagement rings for fun getting an idea of what we liked in case my now fiancé asked what I liked. Fast forward, she then worked with my fiancé to get me the perfect ring! I highly suggest you make the trip to visit her at the Woodbury store. You will not be disappointed!",
            "author": "Jen Scheumann"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_nnaiH3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "review": "Kelsey was fantastic! She really took the time to listen to what we wanted and provide options. If we liked something that was out of our budget, she researched comparables and sent pictures to us so we didn't need to go back to the store. Never felt pressure to purchase something. We will be back!",
            "author": "Lacey Jensen"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_q8rTba": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "review": "From engagement rings to wedding bands and all the ring cleaning in between, my fiancé and I have loved having Sara with us every step of the way. Not only Sara, but all of the Wedding Day Diamonds staff are always so friendly and welcoming, always ready for a nice conversation (no awkwardness there!). Thank you for helping us with all of our diamond needs!",
            "author": "Gena Nelson"
          }
        }
      },
